    "name": "My Little Cafe Nightmare",
    "steam_appid": 3726250,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My little Cafe Nightmare is a spine-chilling but kind of cushy ego-simulation game in which you serve coffee like hot drinks to all kinds of creatures of the night and create a cozy and peacefull spot to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/fc8d84b1692576f53fab2bfb944a4dea.poster.avif?t=1755288183\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/fc8d84b1692576f53fab2bfb944a4dea.webm?t=1755288183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/9e2d51c547074a2baff6655a7e501ec9.avif?t=1755288183\" width=307 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The former guests are tired of the rotten and run down look of this old cafe. Redesign the shop, keep it clean and make it a place where all sorts of creatures feel comfortable at.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/547d25345affe783a2994d71949402bd.poster.avif?t=1755288183\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/547d25345affe783a2994d71949402bd.webm?t=1755288183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/ea5e9c0611650c945ac2656a2b06d7db.avif?t=1755288183\" width=307 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main task will be to brew a good coffee with all kinds of flavours because your guests have there own special tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/246c11ae601f5ddd19e93558e18c732e.poster.avif?t=1755288183\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/246c11ae601f5ddd19e93558e18c732e.webm?t=1755288183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/f7c84585371e098b2623798ebdef6c12.avif?t=1755288183\" width=307 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always keep track of your Ingredients and amount of cups you can serve. You can use the ordering system to stock up your goods but keep your storage efficient and easy to access for timly use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/1b8803e7d72cf17bd517de2dfcd1f8e5.poster.avif?t=1755288183\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/1b8803e7d72cf17bd517de2dfcd1f8e5.webm?t=1755288183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My little Cafe Nightmare is a spine-chilling but kind of cushy ego-simulation game in which you serve coffee like hot drinks to all kinds of creatures of the night and create a cozy and peacefull spot to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/fc8d84b1692576f53fab2bfb944a4dea.poster.avif?t=1755288183\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/fc8d84b1692576f53fab2bfb944a4dea.webm?t=1755288183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/9e2d51c547074a2baff6655a7e501ec9.avif?t=1755288183\" width=307 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The former guests are tired of the rotten and run down look of this old cafe. Redesign the shop, keep it clean and make it a place where all sorts of creatures feel comfortable at.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/547d25345affe783a2994d71949402bd.poster.avif?t=1755288183\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/547d25345affe783a2994d71949402bd.webm?t=1755288183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/ea5e9c0611650c945ac2656a2b06d7db.avif?t=1755288183\" width=307 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main task will be to brew a good coffee with all kinds of flavours because your guests have there own special tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/246c11ae601f5ddd19e93558e18c732e.poster.avif?t=1755288183\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/246c11ae601f5ddd19e93558e18c732e.webm?t=1755288183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/f7c84585371e098b2623798ebdef6c12.avif?t=1755288183\" width=307 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always keep track of your Ingredients and amount of cups you can serve. You can use the ordering system to stock up your goods but keep your storage efficient and easy to access for timly use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/1b8803e7d72cf17bd517de2dfcd1f8e5.poster.avif?t=1755288183\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/1b8803e7d72cf17bd517de2dfcd1f8e5.webm?t=1755288183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
